{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" \n みなさんこんにちは٩( ᐛ )و\n \n 日向坂46の丹生明里(にぶ あかり)です🐸🥕\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3526JVFB27YA2JM4VQRGEQ","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 最近はiPhoneのカメラで撮って、ライトでブリリアンスとかハイライトとか明るさなどなど、、調節することにハマっています！！(^^)(他撮りのとき！)\n \n \n おすすめです！\n \n \n \n \n 時系列順にブログをアップしようと思っているのでだいぶラグがあります。すみません😭\n \n \n \n \n この間の音符衣装がだーいすきで！沢山撮ったので載せきれなかったものを載せる写真ブログになっています😆\n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3527GQS4YVSCCFTDKDMM3D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n えっへん！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3528EZK5WN0SS809YP0PP4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n どうも〜にぶあかりです。🐸🥕 \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ3529F22QV2MVV266QRRRC8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n なになに〜\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352AGK2R6VJJ69SGYCK8HF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n ばいばーい！\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352BE5WA92GEF9JCMDRS8A","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n あっ、やっほー笑\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352CD47ZN3GGX5576JPBWF","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n 手が大きいんです〜\n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352DC3Y9B1GBES9Q90SR0M","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n いぇえええええい！😆\n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352EB9126HWGM1DVS8CXX9","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ352FAT08CAVN9R5GZVWWSW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n 入って〜って言ったら近くにいた二期生ちゃんが！いぇい！(^^)\n \n \n \n 読んでいただきありがとうございました\n \n #238"}],"source":"archive"}